{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Then those who fear YHWH spoke</b> — the discerning." "<b>And it was written</b> means: written in heaven with a writing that shall not be erased." "<b>Who fear HaShem</b> — they are the righteous." "<b>And those who think of His name</b> — they are the wise of heart, knowers of the sod of the name, the honored and the awesome,"], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:25.141510411Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}